{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t日本共同社報道，宮城縣有自衛隊貨車與私家車相撞，造成1死2傷。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n報道說，當地時間早上約7時，一名自衛隊員報警稱他們與一輛私家車正面相撞。私家車男司機死亡，自衛隊貨車上2名自衛隊員受傷。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n當地警方正在調查事故原因。\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.472191+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T05:46:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T19:53:09.827149+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:11.582907+00:00","content_hash":"fc6f24504e54349b3f05e57ad33a5583e759f19652f5b0fef6f0a9d451d384ce","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}